.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3部のが人気だったかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10枚目の最後となりましたが、\n本当に充実した握手会になりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はじめての方も常連さんも\nアンダーライブの話や\nカフェの話\nのぎ天の話など、\n話題に尽きなくて\n楽しかったよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとう！\n11枚目もいろんなお話しようね(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"只今、ある計画を企んでいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーにもアンケート取ったり\nしてるんだけど、\nまとめて何かを考えるって難しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全部採用したいくらい（ ;  ; ）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててね〜( ´ ▽ ` )ﾉ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！今日はこの辺で！\nまた書きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/02/13/9071391/0015.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-34144":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の全国ツアー2016\n終わりました！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"という事で\nレポをしようと思うんですが\nなんせBIRTHDAY LIVE"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日間全然違うセトリなので\n1つのブログに収まらなかった！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"から とりあえず\n初日からレポします"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲数も多ければ\n出てない曲も多いので\n中田よりのレポになりますが悪しからず。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"影アナ まいやん・さゆりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Overture\nぐるぐるカーテン○\n会いたかったかもしれない○\n左胸の勇気○\n失いたくないから○\n乃木坂の詩○\n白い雲にのって○\n-VTR-\nおいでシャンプー○\nハウス！○\n-MC-\n心の薬○\n偶然を言い訳にして\n狼に口笛を\n水玉模様\n-MC-\n-VTR-\n走れ！Bicycle○\n人はなぜ走るのか？○\n涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\n音が出ないギター○\n海流の島よ\nせっかちなかたつむり○\n-VTR-\n-MC-\n渋谷ブルース\nここじゃないどこか\nやさしさなら間に合ってる\n制服のマネキン\n指望遠鏡\n春のメロディー○\n-MC-\n-VTR-\n200ギガあげちゃう\n-MC-\n-VTR-\nなぞの落書き\n傾斜する○\n誰かは味方\n僕がいる場所\nあなたのために弾きたい\n革命の馬\nひとりよがり\n自由の彼方○\n-VTR-\nロマンティックいか焼き\nシャキイズム○\nサイコキネシスの可能性○\nでこぴん\n13日の金曜日\n-VTR-\n君の名は希望○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"[encore]\nガールズルール○\n夏のFree&Easy○\n太陽ノック○\n-MC-\n裸足でSummer○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BIRTHDAY LIVEなので\n発売した順番で披露してますが\nアルバムだけ変則的で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日は\n1st～5thシングル＋1stアルバム\nを披露しました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Overture前"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"円陣を生中継でやりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"玲香と久々に一緒にステージに立てたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいシャン前のVTR"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田をクローズアップしたVTRでした(´；ω；｀)\nありがとうございます(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話が長い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走れ！Bicycle"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"フロートに乗りました！\nスタンド席の方の近くにもいけるから好きです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サイン入りTシャツをハンディキャノンでとばしたよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかちなかたつむり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まいまい卒業ライブに引き続き\nフルでやらせていただきました(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春メロ後のMC"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田が仕切りでやらせていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ロマンティックいか焼き"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お気づきの方もいましたが\n曲順の関係で出れませんでした(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブでやってて本当に楽しい曲だから\n出たかった..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"君の名は希望"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花火！バーン！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンコール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"サインボール投げさせてもらいました～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おいシャンやその前のVTR、\nせっかちに春メロと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日間の中で\n初日が一番、中田を知っていただけるセトリだったと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初日の感想お待ちしております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/08/31/1653044/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2日目レポ\n少々お待ち下さい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-1455":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはようございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/sun.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日更新するはずが\n書いてる途中で寝てしまったヽ(；；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お手数かけますが\n昨日書いた記事だと思って\n読んでください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこ\n見てくださいましたか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/icon/cherry.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２月２２日\nＣＤデビュー決定しました！！\n今後も\n乃木坂46を応援よろしくお願いします〇┓"},{"